ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oYN3PPUmM8wQ7kNvwEbTyDU&_nc_oc=Adpzd84taPRikNwVRjyvN5ThbJQbkoVrU7RTAOrYXHmC31ew2W1d6Sx8bdEMxgGQ6pw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af1R-Vg0rodT_BmiXQOYhktsswU0pSm5GYx2Aj7DhMqRrg&oe=69F4AB2B"}, {"file_name": "DirtRacing_Screenshots_SS5.png", "id": "956140170430457", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620504_956140173763790_4367439451626191946_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JZnaocHmYiUQ7kNvwEO8ujC&_nc_oc=AdpxRbSbckwsQY-f6hINo2x0CRA5NOnjC9cgNdDV0iBMQKsJ3lm5cbEuO3r10vO4x28&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af11On28i7_nSopojYkkYdMH8ZOzl2TGq7zT-jbFas7pOw&oe=69F4BD71"}, {"file_name": "DirtRacing_Screenshots_SS4.png", "id": "1663737814971264", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618515_1663737818304597_5513392942512896735_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=S7585hGVFxoQ7kNvwGNUZdb&_nc_oc=AdrI_vvrSjLVlxvuslAEIPaguuU6db_Q7xtErikMSXF3L2Vy0clWJes-U4graJyqhpw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af3kzBnGs1MNQVAykYh2CS2b0fKiPEtV97AHXO4KQLariA&oe=69F4AAEE"}, {"file_name": "DirtRacing_Screenshots_SS3.png", "id": "4463414757312337", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618102_4463414760645670_4621950848041327339_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Vd7llYeOQzMQ7kNvwEzUaF_&_nc_oc=AdqvtfHw7VEuYSX1UA3qCjMeZ0pxu3HJFg8stOl_YSJ-2eIkNJf3e5m1T1hbyMBdD00&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af24SEVMQeEozwUmx4kyCU8KEOhNz2a6kgYKIKAthpFAqA&oe=69F4C5B5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Dirt Racing: SUV Offroad Challenge", "keywords": ["racing", "offroad", "dirt", "SUV", "car"], "long_description": "Get behind the wheel for the most immersive offroad experience in VR. Dirt Racing: SUV Offroad Challenge puts you in the cockpit of high-performance 4x4s to conquer punishing terrain, unpredictable weather, and aggressive AI rivals. This isn't just a game; it's a precision-tuned sim where every jump and drift feels dangerously real.\n\nPHYSICAL VR CONTROLS\nStep into a fully interactive cockpit where your hands do the driving.\n\nManual Handling: Grab the steering wheel, pull the handbrake for sharp drifts, and shift gears.\n\nTactile Interactions: Reach out to adjust your mirrors or blast the NOS to overtake the pack.\n\nPro Physics: Feel the weight of your vehicle with a suspension system built for realistic mud and dirt traction.\n\nCONQUER EVERY TERRAIN\nFrom high-speed stadium speedways to our signature dense jungle circuits, every race is a battle for the line. Navigate thick mud, steep hills, and lakeside trails where your reflexes are the difference between victory and a wipeout.\n\nGAME FEATURES:\nThree Competitive Modes: Dominate in Circuit Racing, Sprints, and Best Lap challenges.\n\nDynamic Environments: Master the dirt through changing light and weather cycles.\n\nAggressive AI: Trade paint with a full field of rivals fighting for the podium.\n\nDeep Customization: Personalize your ride with a wide variety of unique liveries.\n\nGlobal Leaderboards: Prove you\u2019re the fastest 4x4 driver in the world.\n\nOutrun the pack. Dominate the dirt. Own the trail.", "short_description": "Ultimate 4x4 SUV racing simulator! Battle aggressive AI rivals in high-stakes offroad races. Experience true VR immersion: grab the steering wheel, rip the handbrake, & blast the NOS. Conquer mud, stadium, & jungle tracks in high-performance offroaders.\n\nPro Physics: Realistic suspension & traction on varied terrain.\n\nDynamic Racing: Multiple modes, global leaderboards, & changing light cycles.\n\nFull Customization: Personalize your ride with unique liveries.\n\nOutrun the pack. Dominate the dirt."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/gamotronixstudio/privacypolicy-meta", "developer_terms_of_service_url"